{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-f26c5646a21a","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-f26c5646a21a","name":"糖醋汁","category":"condiment","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/condiment/%E7%B3%96%E9%86%8B%E6%B1%81.md","blob_sha":"31f4fb949baf77f3cea06812b8a6238b9a4a6da7","details":{"introduction":"这款调味汁酸甜可口，是中餐里糖醋菜肴的经典风味来源。调制简单、比例易记，新手也能轻松上手，从备料到完成约需 10 分钟。糖分能提供能量，醋香有助于开胃解腻，让家常菜瞬间变得有滋有味。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 清水\n- 白糖\n- 白醋/米醋\n- 料酒\n- 生抽"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"- 清水(50ml)\n- 生抽(40ml)\n- 白糖(30g)\n- 白醋(20ml)\n- 料酒(10ml)"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 按照比例将各调料在小碗中搅拌均匀\n2. 按不同菜肴的方式处理完毕后，将配制好的糖醋汁倒入锅中\n3. 根据各菜肴的不同，烹制 5-10 分钟\n4. 大火收汁，可增加菜的浓度、香味和光泽"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：白砂糖40g、白醋40g、通用酱油（shoyu近似）20g、番茄酱40g、饮用水50g；整份约180g。番茄酱版本，不用料酒，白醋作明确标准选择。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":118.333333,"protein_g":1.135556,"carbohydrate_g":28.867778,"fat_g":0.085556},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients","version":"08532f0066d73215","fdc_ids":[169655,172237,174277,168556,173647]},"profile_id":"family-f26c5646a21a-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-f26c5646a21a","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-f26c5646a21a","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"simmer","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":true,"brand":null,"variant":"family-f26c5646a21a-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"sugar","grams":40},{"key":"vinegar","grams":40},{"key":"soy","grams":20},{"key":"ketchup","grams":40},{"key":"water","grams":50}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data